    preview: "Turkish cargo ship catches fire after Black Sea drone attack A Turkish cargo ship caught fire after a drone attack near Russia’s Black Sea port of Novorossiysk. Turkiye’s maritime authority said three crew members were seriously injured and all 22 onboard were evacuated to Russia.",
    body: "Turkish cargo ship catches fire after Black Sea drone attack\n\nA Turkish cargo ship caught fire after a drone attack near Russia’s Black Sea port of Novorossiysk. Turkiye’s maritime authority said three crew members were seriously injured and all 22 onboard were evacuated to Russia.",
    content_status: "full",
